==Description==
This template is used to create notification banners.

==Parameters==
; <code>1=</code>, <code>color=</code>
: A color to be used throughout the template. Any color that is [https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/color_value valid in CSS] is valid here.
; <code>2=</code>, <code>symb=</code>
: A symbol to display on the left and right sides of the template.
; <code>3=</code>, <code>text=</code>
: The text to display inside the notification.

==Examples==
<pre>{{notify
  | 1 = #22364a
  | 2 = V
  | 3 = This is a sample notification.
}}</pre>

<br />
<pre>
{{Notify
  | 1 = #22364a
  | 2 = V
  | 3 = This EDIT subject is a '''EDIT_TEXT'''.{{#if:{{{1|}}}|&nbsp;The reasons include: '''{{{1}}}'''.}}<br /><small>This is a detailed notification. More subjects categorized [[:Category:|here]].</small>
}}<includeonly>[[Category:]]</includeonly><noinclude>{{TYPE templates/doc}}</noinclude>
</pre>

<br />
{{notify
  | 1 = #22364a
  | 2 = V
  | 3 = This is a sample notification.
}}
